# With completed blocks hidden, completing a starred task drops it and its starred subtask from the Starred view and its count.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Book hotel @star
		- Compare prices @star
	- Pack @star
END
keys gS gc x
hide Book hotel
hide Compare prices
keys <C-g>
see │▌ 󰓎 Starred                                 1 │
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	- Book hotel @star @done({today})
		- Compare prices @star
	- Pack @star
END
